OL,3,AAre interest rates on the way up again?
OL,4,
OL,5,FThere's nothing like talk of energy
OL,6,Fprices and potential higher borrowing
OL,7,Fcosts to remind us that the summer
OL,8,Fholidays are well and truly over.
OL,10,FSurging oil prices have been pushing up
OL,11,Fwhat drivers pay at the fuel pumps and
OL,12,Feating away at household budgets for
OL,13,Fmonths, and concerns remain over
OL,14,Fwhether the economic impact of the
OL,15,FUS-Iran war will drive the cost of
OL,16,Fliving higher.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
