OL,3,AAre interest rates on the way up again?
OL,4,
OL,5,FCiting the Middle East conflict and
OL,6,Fwarning inflation was "set to remain
OL,7,Fwell above" its 2% target for some
OL,8,Ftime, the European Central Bank
OL,9,Frecently raised interest rates to to
OL,10,F2.5%,
OL,12,FOther central banks are also
OL,13,Fresponding, with the US and the UK
OL,14,Fpoised to make interest-rate decisions
OL,15,Fnext week.
